


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_0bf53ccc:


    "——元旦晚上。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_0f361ad2:


    "祥子正在洗碗。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_fb840934:



    voice "2MI_1131"
    miyako "「哈！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_e46cefc1:


    "趴在桌上睡觉的圣夜子突然醒来，四下张望。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_035abc8d:



    voice "2SA_0961"
    sachiko "「啊，你醒啦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_dfa4f0fd:



    voice "2MI_1132"
    miyako "「这里是……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_8375e944:



    voice "2SA_0962"
    sachiko "「宿管室」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_df8bbaf0:


    "她似乎是睡迷糊了，不知道自己在哪。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_33e234c6:



    voice "2SA_0963"
    sachiko "「看你一脸诧异，是做梦了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_178c7c82:



    voice "2MI_1133"
    miyako "「做梦……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_8d85efc2:



    voice "2SA_0964"
    sachiko "「啊，你是第一次做梦吧。名副其实的初梦啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_79d1bb9c:


    "天使不会做梦，因为天使不会睡觉。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_0cd37176:


    "虽然有关于“梦”的知识，但这是她第一次亲身体验。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_64bd6e4d:



    voice "2SA_0965"
    sachiko "「梦见什么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_171d9d90:



    voice "2MI_1134"
    miyako "「呃……梦到吃煮年糕了」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_33557f17:



    voice "2SA_0966"
    sachiko "「不不，你刚才确实吃了煮年糕」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_d66d50f0:



    voice "2MI_1135"
    miyako "「有煮年糕的香味和味道」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_69b25780:



    voice "2SA_0967"
    sachiko "「所以说你刚才真的吃了啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_64d57e20:



    voice "2MI_1136"
    miyako "「然后出现了茄子、富士山和老鹰」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_76c354f8:



    voice "2SA_0968"
    sachiko "「三种全凑全了，你怎么也不嫌多啊，喂」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_dfdf6a99:



    voice "2MI_1137"
    miyako "「啊咧咧？记不清了。直到刚才都还很清楚的……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_feb7c8c0:



    voice "2SA_0969"
    sachiko "「梦就是这样的」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_ef78124e:


    "祥子把桌上剩下的餐具放进洗碗池。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_a7ff4c0d:


    "圣夜子朝正背对着她洗餐具的祥子说道。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_2bfd45c4:



    voice "2MI_1138"
    miyako "「你有请过其他天使下来吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_354cbcbe:



    voice "2SA_0970"
    sachiko "「只请过你」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_efd1411a:



    voice "2MI_1139"
    miyako "「这样啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_5932b3cf:


    "她似乎松了一口气（虽然本人没有察觉）。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_c6d2e93c:



    voice "2MI_1140"
    miyako "「为什么要邀请我呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_06a90b30:



    voice "2SA_0971"
    sachiko "「不知不觉……吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_aa6dc8a7:



    voice "2MI_1141"
    miyako "「这样啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_b3325979:


    "她似乎有些失望（虽然本人没有察觉）。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_129a2b3a:



    voice "2MI_1142"
    miyako "「你是被谁邀请的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_8f14cb7f:



    voice "2SA_0972"
    sachiko "「那是——」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_0fd4d656_1:


    "……………"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_aa7ea8b0:


    "祥子停下洗碗池的水，回过头。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_27b98ebf:



    voice "2MI_1143"
    miyako "「唔……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_049f2e3b:


    "而圣夜子又睡了过去。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_0d77cd7a:



    voice "2SA_0973"
    sachiko "「诶，太快了吧！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_275b9180:


    "祥子擦了擦手，回到起居室，坐在了圣夜子身边。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_a340cae3:



    voice "2SA_0974"
    sachiko "「真的很能睡啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_155dc03b:


    "她看着圣夜子的睡脸，自言自语道。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_fac48017:


    "从圣诞节圣夜子降落到地到现在，看她睡觉的时间比和她说话的时间还长。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_34210b67:



    voice "2SA_0975"
    sachiko "「你刚下来的时候，看到你的脸，我还以为是她」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_4d9d23fc:



    voice "2SA_0976"
    sachiko "「但是长相相同的你们，摆出的表情却截然不同。随着交流深入，也就越能发现你们气质上的不同。你们的的确确是两个不同的人」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_2cf60876:



    voice "2SA_0977"
    sachiko "「……这么巧的事，有可能吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_72f0790d:



    voice "2SA_0978"
    sachiko "「我觉得事出有因，觉得有一个心眼坏透了的家伙在从中作祟」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_722c5cc0:



    voice "2SA_0979"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_80ccaba2:



    voice "2SA_0980"
    sachiko "「但一切都是单纯的偶然。你真的一无所知」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_d88b86a6:


    "祥子叹了口气，注视着圣夜子的脸。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_7337a65f:



    voice "2SA_0981"
    sachiko "「睡相倒是（和她）一样」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_cbd7b6e8:


    "她的手不禁伸向圣夜子的脸……"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_8f6febe5:



    voice "2SA_0982"
    sachiko "「啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_a8b5be98:


    "圣夜子则毫无察觉地继续睡着。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_03_0ec8ca90:



    voice "2SA_0983"
    sachiko "「……怎么可能嘛」"
